  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Legal and Technical Support in Dispute Settlement on the Lot 3 Contract of the Northern Corridor Route Improvement Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the services contract is to assist, advise, represent and defend the interests of the Contracting Authority (NAO of the EDF) and their counsel (the Attorney General of Uganda) before the EDF Arbitral Tribunal and all parallel legal procedures in the two disputes on contract FED/2010/259-788 (Lot 3 of the Northern Corridor Route Improvement Project).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
